Cheren: {VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE01}
This bothersome bunch doesn't
really listen to reason.{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: That child cannot use
a Pokémon to its full potential.{VAR BE01}
Doesn't that make the Pokémon sad?{VAR BE01}
It's the same thing for all your Pokémon,
so hand them over to us now!{VAR BE01}
Better yet...
We'll just take them!{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: How troublesome.{VAR BE01}
Not only do you fail to understand, but
you actually got in our way, to boot.{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: There's two of you
and two of us.{VAR BE01}
We'll show you our combined power
and teach you that we are right!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: So, there were more of them...{VAR BE01}
Still, why are Pokémon robbers
acting so self-righteous?{VAR BE01}

{VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE01}
We've been friends our whole lives.
We've got each other's back when it{VAR BE00}
counts. Let's show them how it's done!{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: In order to liberate
Pokémon from foolish people,{VAR BE00}
we will take their Pokémon!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Whatever...
What a waste of time.{VAR BE01}
Come on, what reason could possibly
justify stealing Pokémon from people?{VAR BE01}

Cheren: What do you mean, Trainers are
making Pokémon suffer?{VAR BE00}
I don't get that at all!{VAR BE01}

Team Plasma: We'll give you back
the Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
But be aware of how this Pokémon suffers
from being used by people.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Trainers bring out
their Pokémon's strength.{VAR BE01}
Pokémon believe in their
Trainers and respond to that.{VAR BE01}
I don't understand what about
that makes Pokémon suffer!{VAR BE01}
